# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo. Dev happens on Windows but the
# deploy target (Railway/Linux) and Prettier both expect LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat binary assets as binary so Git never touches their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.heic binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
